# Cloudflare Pages redirects, read from the output directory. One rule per line:
#   <from>  <to>  <status>
#
# www redirects to the apex, not the reverse. Picked because the apex is what
# goes on a resume and in an App Store listing, and a bare domain is shorter to
# say out loud. Recorded here because acceptance criterion 1 of story #4 asks
# for the direction to be chosen deliberately rather than inherited.
#
# Both hostnames still have to be attached to the Pages project in the
# dashboard - this file decides what happens once a request arrives, not
# whether it can.
#
# Deliberately absent: the 301 from madcowhq.com/sailing. Nothing links there,
# and epic #1 puts it out of scope until something does.
https://www.madcowhq.com/*  https://madcowhq.com/:splat  301
